# Local secrets — never commit (holds the live game API key)
.env
.env.*

# Live game bookkeeping — one player's probe state, not source.
# Upstream tracks these, which merged its author's explored-sector counts into
# ours (HomeSetup.md Step 5 concedes the repo ships their data). Untracked here
# so pulls stop blending two players' games; the api-server recreates them.
artifacts/api-server/data/
